{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026PmcgNAIqM31792662329.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>想在家中品嚐滋補養生的靚湯？李家鼎（鼎爺）曾在《阿爺廚房》中親自示範炮製「腐竹白果燉雞湯」。金華火腿的鹹香與雞肉的鮮甜完美交融，配合腐竹與白果的清潤，入口鮮醇濃郁、甘甜回味，絕對是滋陰養生的必學佳品！</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"c37256a0-39bb-4a3d-a98f-da4960f9995b.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20269qmKccU7vj1792662328.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>食材</p><ul><li><p>雞</p></li><li><p>瘦肉</p></li><li><p>金華火腿</p></li><li><p>白果</p></li><li><p>腐竹</p></li><li><p>炸枝竹</p></li></ul><p>烹調步驟</p><ol><li><p><strong>處理食材</strong></p><p>先將雞隻與瘦肉放入滾水汆水備用；白果用刀背輕敲去殼，汆水後迅速過冷河，即可輕鬆撕去薄衣。</p></li><li><p><strong>釀入雞腔</strong></p><p>將部分去衣白果、金華火腿及瘦肉，均勻地塞進雞腔之內。</p></li><li><p><strong>鋪底注入熱水</strong></p><p>準備燉盅，底層先鋪上炸枝竹、剩餘的瘦肉及腐竹，再放入釀好的全雞與剩餘白果，最後注入熱開水至大約九成滿。</p></li><li><p><strong>密封燉煮</strong></p><p>蓋妥燉盅蓋，外圍以耐熱保鮮紙緊密包好，隔水慢火燉煮約4小時，一盅清甜靚湯即大功告成。</p></li></ol><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"754db17d-af73-47f0-9b92-ddd5707bd192.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026l5cOUb2vJP1792662329.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:44:14.650688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:09.021051+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:18.364346+00:00","content_hash":"ed16eb2e1dcf8029768d351c47ebe8a2127068139e5e819c8b8daadc308928df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:44:14.650688+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}